WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.026
Silamaka e Poullori. Gooto go'o e Mali.

00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.194
Silamaama, laamiiɗo mawɗo. E Poullori, gooduɗo maako, mo walaa kulol.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:20.128
On meeɗaa yi'ugo ɓe goɗɗum.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.944
Siilaamaama o ɓeydi sukaajo nde hocci dow maako nder lekki.

00:00:39.000 --> 00:00:42.792
Sey o wurtini jungo maako, ammaa asama duumii.

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:50.696
O laatoowo maako.

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:11.536
Sey laamiiɗo Segoo wari, o wurtini yimɓe fuu ceede.

00:01:15.000 --> 00:01:17.736
Sey lilaaɓe maako ngari, ɓe njaɓii ko o wi'i.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:29.816
Sey yimɓe fuu ndilli, ɓe ndaari Siilaama.

00:01:43.000 --> 00:01:44.856
Silamaama ɓadake dow le'i.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:50.572
Yeccu laamiiɗo mon en njaɓataa ceede.

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:57.498
Sey lilaaɓe ɓen ummii. Koo moye anndi ko wara.

00:02:16.000 --> 00:02:21.898
Yimɓe Ségou ngari. Silamaama e Poullori ɓe ngaddani mo, ɓe ndilli bee maako.

00:02:40.000 --> 00:02:44.864
Nde Siilaama'en waɗi ko o wi'i, haykaliiru wari hakkunde maɓɓe.

00:02:52.000 --> 00:02:55.232
Walaa gooduɗo ɓerɗe maɓɓe, ɓe ndilli.

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:09.272
Silamaama ɗon heɓa jaalorgal, Poullori boo ɗon haaje bee maako.

00:03:16.000 --> 00:03:19.776
Nder jemma, goonɗinɓe ɗiɗo ɓe njehi nder jayngol.

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:32.706
Baylitɗe goɗɗe mbi'i ɗum ɓeydaama. Yimɓe fuu mbi'i Poullori dillaay mo.

00:03:47.500 --> 00:03:56.208
Silamaama, ɓiɗɗo hakkiilo! Poullori, duɗal goonɗinɗo! Inɗe mon ɗon maaya, haa e woodi gooŋgaajo!
